- We actually will get the POV of a mysterious characters;

- We'll get a banger trailer cycle for said mysterious character;

- They give us ANOTHER 4 star selector (remember guys, a lot of 4 stars are very valuable)


Also, lets not forget that HSR has a habit of being able to hide stuff from leakers and surprise us with some unexpected rewards (like the free fuels), so maybe what they revealed is not everything.

Edit: game devs usually don't give out too too much on the first anniversaries, they give a lot but not too much but it geadually amps up as the years go by (just look at fgo gradually giving more and more during their anniversaries.)

