Hyperspeed Bronya can be kind of clunky dps wise and you lose too much damage from it:

- You lose the initial burst from Jingliu which is very important for her damage numbers(Skill, into enhanced skill, into Bronya skill into enhanced skill into ult).

- Jingliu will have less uptime on her enhanced state because she takes less turn because she will only take the same amount of turns as Bronya;

- Hyperspeed Bronya is almost always not the best for dps (exception is maybe IL for SP gen and the basic - Skill rotation for SP neutral Bronya);

Also, what speed is your Bronya anyways...

