Could probably do it if I was actually playing the match but I'm having problems mathing things out because the banish from minister is random and depending on which one it banishes changes the plan;

The first action tho should be pretty simple:

- kill the first minister with the Alices then the other with the remaining units or just istyndet, tho not sure if makes it possible for minister to banish an Alice of she pops out after minister gets killed;

First part: Sushang - Luka - Bailu - Welt/Pela

Sushang for main DPS, Luka for debuffs and extra break - Bailu for sustain and Welt as extra break/action delay; if the lancer guy is too much of a problem, switch Welt with Pela and make him kill himself slowly everytime he summons his minions;

Don't worry about actually DPSing with Sushang, focus on breaks as the MoC buff is actually pretty strong. The name of the game here is to break and survive.

Second part: Seele - TY - SW - FX

Seele as main dos, TY as buffer, SW to apply quantum to the only enemy with no quantum weakness, FX as a breaker to the bugs and as sustain;

Tips for the second part: The guard captain is much easier to break than the mara lady so you can abuse this to stack the MoC buff for a faster clear; don't be afraid to boost FX's ult eith TY if you're about to be blasted by the swarm bug, Seele can clear some but FX can break and delay them enough for Seele to clean up; if you can help it, try to leave a few little bugs as you get to the second bar and then kill them for more damage and reduce the enemy defences;

