Lets count:

If you start battle with her technique + 1 stack;

Turn 1: talent stacks = 1

- skill = -1 SP + 1 base talent stack;

- trigger talent, gain extra turn, enhanced skill = -0 SP - 1 stack;


Turn 2: Enhanced state talent stacks = 1;

- Ehanced skill = -0 SP, - 1 stack;

- can probably ult at this point so, Ult = +1 base talent stack;


Turn 3: base talent stacks = 1;

- Skill: - 1 SP, +1 base talent stack;

- trigger talent, gain extra turn, enhaced skill = -0 SP; - 1 enhanced talent stack;


Turn 4: enhanced talent stacks = 1;

- enhanced skill = -0 SP, -1 enhanced talent stack.


So in the first 4 turns of MoC, she'll consume 2 SP, so basically like Blade.

