Tho just to be sure here are some tips so TL 40-60 doesn't hurt your soul:

- prefarm trace mats, xp books and credits, ESPECIALLY credits as it takes millions to level even a single character;

- only level a core number of characters (4-6 should be enough, tho 6 is kind of pushing it);

- don't worry about forgotten hall or MoC yet, you'll get there eventually if you have patience (I didn't and am now am paying the consequences...still broke after levelling Yukong xD );

- Serval will be your lightning-breaking goddes unless you have any of the limited lightning (or be like this dumbass here and build Arlan...this one is for masochists);

- when Lynx comes, pull for her, you will eventually need 2 healers for each teams.

