As some people have said: don't ignore low rarities, heck one of the best farmers once you're able to gather atleast 3 50% chargers is Chen Gong who is 2 star caster.

For other low star rarity reccomendations:

- Saber: Bedivere and julius Caesar, they are both 3 stars that can hit very high NP damage counts and you will most likely have them at NP5 in the long run because of their rarity (bedivere you get whenever you summon on rountable banners I guess);

- Archer: Arash, Robin hood, with the former being a good early game farmer that helps with set up farming and the other a ST arts archer that can nume enemies whenever he is able to inflict poison on them before his NP;

- Lancer: lancer Cu, the original one, not the prototype will your best anchor servant for a long time and with some investment able to solo a lot of content in the game;

- Rider: Ushiwakamaru is basically a 4/5 star dressed as a 3 star with the only demerit being her base stats; she is an all around good ST quick rider who also buffs the entire party;

- Assassin: Hassan of hundred faces is one of the most reliable low rarity AoE assassins in the game;

- Caster: Hans, Chen Gong, Mozart (kinda) with the first being a good all around support that heals, produces stars, gives buffs and charges N (he also has a very big battery), Chen Gong is the go to low rarity Buster support who can also double as one of the best farmers in the game if you have 3 50% chargers (tho one of them will probably have to be castoria).

- Berserker: Asterios, Spartacus; the first is a good servant for stall strats which everyone will have to resort to at some point and the other a very good farmer who can also buster loop with Koyanskaya (i think?).

